url: "https://github.com/1337isnot1337/solved-conjectures"
abstract: >-
  Four unrefereed research notes include a counterexample to the published
  L-solitaire limit-shape conjecture, a counterexample to Pham's original
  exact denominator-degree conjecture, an explicit non-spider counterexample
  to Li's chromatic-symmetric-function coefficient-sign prediction, and a proof of Batista's Egyptian-fraction congruence.
  Includes exact proofs, certificates, and reproducible Python verification.
